OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian scandal should be    
OL,4,Awatershed moment - BMA                 
OL,6,FA series of failures in patient care at
OL,7,FNHS Grampian should be a watershed     
OL,8,Fmoment, the chairwoman of the BMA in   
OL,9,FScotland has said.                     
OL,11,FDr Nora Murray-Cavanagh said the public
OL,12,Fwere "horrified" by the revelations at 
OL,13,Fthe health board but she hoped an      
OL,14,Findependent review would uncover the   
OL,15,Ftruth of what happened.                
OL,17,FHer comments came after a scathing     
OL,18,Freport from the health watchdog        
OL,19,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland found  
OL,20,F"major deficiencies" in NHS Grampian's 
OL,21,Fleadership and culture.                
